<title>DENMARK: SOCCER-BRONDBY 0 TENERIFE 2 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRONDBY 0 TENERIFE 2 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BRONDBY, Denmark 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Tenerife beat Brondby of Denmark 2-0 (halftime 1-0, 90 minutes 1-0) after extra time in their UEFA Cup quarter final second leg match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Antonio Pinilla 21, Antonio Mata Olivera 120</p>
<p>Tenerife win 2-1 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
